    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Anima Shin Gun is a Bullet Hell Rail Shooter where you get shot to survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage enemies and absorb their bullets as \u201cseconds of life\u201d by switching to the right color frequency. Thus, surviving long enough to break the time loop you\u2019re trapped in and complete the ENTIRE adventure before the countdown gets to zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840820/extras/dface2f2913ae15ca4157729dc9ef83e.poster.avif?t=1733774934\" width=608 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840820/extras/dface2f2913ae15ca4157729dc9ef83e.webm?t=1733774934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840820/extras/dface2f2913ae15ca4157729dc9ef83e.mp4?t=1733774934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GET SECONDS OF PLAY TIME BY GETTING SHOT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A big countdown on top and a grand amount of bullets on screen that YOU DON'T AVOID but, when hit while being with the same color, give you seconds of play time for your current playthrough. if you don't get enough seconds, or just didn't spend them wisely, it is game over back to the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840820/extras/da568a64cfb534c1cbe3e6525cf6c5ad.poster.avif?t=1733774934\" width=608 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840820/extras/da568a64cfb534c1cbe3e6525cf6c5ad.webm?t=1733774934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840820/extras/da568a64cfb534c1cbe3e6525cf6c5ad.mp4?t=1733774934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY AS AMELIA, AN ANIMAL HERO WHO STARTS QUESTIONING HUMANITY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After believing to be a hero for a long time, and discovering she's been living on an endless time loop, Amelia, as an anthropomorphic animal android, starts questioning the real value of humanity. With the help of her corky team, see how this branching story unfolds in a comic, introspective and humanly way through the eyes of animals that once worshipped humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840820/extras/b63d4fcc8b0950c96f54a16f815dcfff.poster.avif?t=1733774934\" width=608 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840820/extras/b63d4fcc8b0950c96f54a16f815dcfff.webm?t=1733774934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840820/extras/b63d4fcc8b0950c96f54a16f815dcfff.mp4?t=1733774934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE WORLDS AND FIGHT THEIR RULERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The secret of the time loop lies between the worlds that conform it. Visit each of them with their  distinguishable environment, culturally recognizable music, and clearly defined Rail Shooter and Third Person Shooter sections to defeat every single one of the corky baddies that look after them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840820/extras/6af623eef3c42ddd5922f5cad1953829.poster.avif?t=1733774934\" width=608 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840820/extras/6af623eef3c42ddd5922f5cad1953829.webm?t=1733774934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840820/extras/6af623eef3c42ddd5922f5cad1953829.mp4?t=1733774934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLOCK PATHS, WEAPONS, VEHICLES AND ABILITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your journey you'll find a variety of weapons and vehicles that, not only will help get through your levels, but also grant you certain abilities (or punishments) and knowledge to help you destroy your enemies and uncover the secrets behind the loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840820/extras/f1a68ea8159ce8e3780d3bfc59d2c249.poster.avif?t=1733774934\" width=608 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840820/extras/f1a68ea8159ce8e3780d3bfc59d2c249.webm?t=1733774934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840820/extras/f1a68ea8159ce8e3780d3bfc59d2c249.mp4?t=1733774934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
